<section class="story-chapter wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Your everyday</p><h2>Tradition belongs<br>at <em>your table.</em></h2></div><div><p>You don’t need a special occasion for good ingredients. A quick tadka, a weekend dosa, a family recipe: the everyday is where goodness matters.</p><p>Choose the flavour you love. Cook the food you know. Let Oorvi take care of the first thing in your pan.</p><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="button">Bring Oorvi home {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a></div></section>
